Root cause:
The bug was caused by an incorrectly defined IRQ trigger type for the GMAC, which was set to `EDGE_RISING` instead of the correct `LEVEL_HIGH`. This misconfiguration led to the `macirq` not being triggered, resulting in a drastic drop in network connection speed and causing the GMAC IRQs to never acknowledge.

